OL,3,AOvercooked? Why robotic pizza makers
OL,4,Aare failing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "dough feeder". The sauce and
OL,7,Fcheese modules ` even the
OL,8,Fpepperoni-sprinkler. All lay still.
OL,10,FA now defunct duo of robots were
OL,11,Fsupposed to be churning out pizzas at a
OL,12,FMoto Pizza restaurant in Seattle.
OL,14,FHowever, in May the pair were rendered
OL,15,F"basically useless" when their
OL,16,Fsupplier, Picnic, abruptly shut down.
OL,17,FTechnical support for the robots
OL,18,Fevaporated at that moment, says Lee
OL,19,FKindell, founder and chief executive of
OL,20,FMoto Pizza.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
