OL,3,AOvercooked? Why robotic pizza makers
OL,4,Aare failing
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was left wondering what to do with
OL,7,Fthe $160,000 (#118,000), cabinet-like
OL,8,Fmachines and whether buying in pizza
OL,9,Fbots was really worth it.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
