OL,3,ASelena Gomez pushes back against
OL,4,A'absurd' fraud claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FSelena Gomez's social media accounts
OL,7,Fbrim with adoring fans: two million
OL,8,Flikes for her most recent post showing
OL,9,Fher and her husband in a rose-petal
OL,10,Fstrewn hotel, and thousands of comments
OL,11,Fpraising her beauty, her lipstick and
OL,12,Fthe perfume brand she founded.
OL,14,FThis week the PR focus for the star -
OL,15,Fwho rose to fame on the Disney channel
OL,16,Fbut has moved into song-writing, films
OL,17,Fand TV drama - was supposed to be on
OL,18,Fthe upcoming series six of Only Murders
OL,19,Fin the Building that sees its
OL,20,Fpodcasting sleuths transfered to London
OL,21,Ffor their next adventure.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787897898
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASelena Gomez pushes back against
OL,4,A'absurd' fraud claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the wider chat - outside those
OL,7,Ffriendly spaces - has gone off-script
OL,8,Fand is largely on a less flattering
OL,9,Ftopic - namely claims from investors
OL,10,Fwho allege she breached her contract by
OL,11,Fnot properly backing the mental health
OL,12,Fplatform Wondermind that she cofounded
OL,13,Fwith her mother five years ago. As a
OL,14,Fresult, the five investors argue, they
OL,15,Fwere defrauded of the nearly $1.2m they
OL,16,Finvested.
OL,18,FGomez is pushing back against those
OL,19,Fallegations - her lawyer has asked that
OL,20,Fshe be dismissed from the case
OL,21,Faltogether, saying the claims made
OL,22,Fagainst her are "threadbare".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
